      "value": "@{5ae14b192f26cf1a6d66ba79|full_name}: What is the goal of the content you upload? I am speaking for myself when I say I love opening streams, and going to worlds seeing people using my avatars. It makes me happy and I know I did a good join. I only see this increasing that long term. As for people going to my maps, that indeed is a completely separate problem that isn't exactly avatar related. I don't have much motive to make worlds anymore. Some players use my Poolside Fireworks map instead of Lag Free Box because it runs better and they can have more people there. But there is no rating system yet and the game is flooded with thousands of worlds but only so many players. I know friends and groups will often say \"lets go world hopping\" go from world to world, see it once, look at a few avatars, once. Then never return. What's the harm in them favoriting one of your avatars that they might forget even exist?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
