  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-29T07:56:36.259Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I do not want other users being able to favorite my avatars in my world as i have spent a lot of time making them and to see my world die out due to less traction because i'm a smaller user is saddening. I spent months working on a base concept for my world and even did a good week of building it and i feel like favoring the users as opposed to considering the content creators as well was a big mistake on VRChats part. We are just as emotionally tied to seeing the people who appreciate our content in our worlds and talking to them, as much as they are attached to the avatars themselves. So do us a favor please, and add the option for avatar pedestals in the sdk to be set permissions to favorite instead of having all pedestals be allowed to.",
